{"4826810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Slope Riders - A Motorbike Escapade", "steam_appid": 4826810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4846080], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Conquer the Slopes, Ride with Thrill!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slope Rider is a story-based off-road motorbike game. Carve across diverse terrain, Beat record times, race against Ghosts, and explore Open Areas across forests, snow, deserts, and rocky canyons. And live the story of a fallen champion's comeback.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/ab2eee87b916f4c0b6fec6806109d9c3.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/ab2eee87b916f4c0b6fec6806109d9c3.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/ab2eee87b916f4c0b6fec6806109d9c3.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slope Rider is a story-based motorbike game focused on terrain traversal, traction, control, and momentum. Ride across steep hills, rocky mountain paths, snowy slopes, and desert landscapes. Every climb requires careful throttle control and weight balance, as pushing too hard can send you tumbling back down the slopes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/4037939a784ec1b5e5948c6ba862ee5e.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/4037939a784ec1b5e5948c6ba862ee5e.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=190 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f7faf2099f41de172d58f62c894ba072.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f7faf2099f41de172d58f62c894ba072.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f7faf2099f41de172d58f62c894ba072.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/7d0a04d856c76bef42e4284f084d08a7.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/7d0a04d856c76bef42e4284f084d08a7.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/7d0a04d856c76bef42e4284f084d08a7.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/86d1d8ebfdc239bfc1eafb9b630c2d15.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/86d1d8ebfdc239bfc1eafb9b630c2d15.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/86d1d8ebfdc239bfc1eafb9b630c2d15.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The terrain is designed to reward precision and experimentation. Learn how different surfaces affect your bike, discover efficient routes, and master increasingly demanding climbs across a variety of environments. Progress through events and challenges while a light story unfolds through in-game cutscenes, following a former champion's journey back to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2000e1f3ae3ac7f6d8722c66bebee724.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/2000e1f3ae3ac7f6d8722c66bebee724.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=267 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/eb6c9ba67dbd529721b90ce6e8a8f7a8.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/eb6c9ba67dbd529721b90ce6e8a8f7a8.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/eb6c9ba67dbd529721b90ce6e8a8f7a8.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/0299da7d1951bbfad918a4b4bb06f0f1.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/0299da7d1951bbfad918a4b4bb06f0f1.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/0299da7d1951bbfad918a4b4bb06f0f1.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/27afb01f6ee3b1ef5f31907de0e270f3.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/27afb01f6ee3b1ef5f31907de0e270f3.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/27afb01f6ee3b1ef5f31907de0e270f3.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features realistic weight shifting controls and bike dynamics. Leaning too far forward or back changes how your bike grips and climbs, so you need to constantly adjust your balance on steep or uneven terrain. And now it's less about speed and more about control — a small mistiming in weight shift can cost you a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/9963dc0059304023d57cf696cf3a7b3d.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/9963dc0059304023d57cf696cf3a7b3d.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=190 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/e4b4442cced8adfa9474acfc4118e3d6.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/e4b4442cced8adfa9474acfc4118e3d6.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/e4b4442cced8adfa9474acfc4118e3d6.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/cf40a836209607748ba268a0cf99f21e.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/cf40a836209607748ba268a0cf99f21e.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/cf40a836209607748ba268a0cf99f21e.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse environments including forests, deserts, snowy regions, and rocky ranges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character and bike customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll crash system with dynamic rider reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person and Third Person Camera Options with Look Back like fun Angles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2cc5dd23539ed9a59011e96577411a23.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2cc5dd23539ed9a59011e96577411a23.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2cc5dd23539ed9a59011e96577411a23.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/97726c34497ff8421debc90bf024a57a.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/97726c34497ff8421debc90bf024a57a.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/97726c34497ff8421debc90bf024a57a.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven motorcycle handling focused on balance and traction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels designed around exploration and skill-based progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light narrative story that follows a rider's struggle, setbacks, and return to competitive success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible controls with depth for players who enjoy mastering vehicle physics.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f0d582490bf064430caf0322f8944aa2.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f0d582490bf064430caf0322f8944aa2.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f0d582490bf064430caf0322f8944aa2.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2658cd6404b53a4c5081bd277fc9373f.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2658cd6404b53a4c5081bd277fc9373f.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2658cd6404b53a4c5081bd277fc9373f.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Available Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hill Climb Fests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Downhill Racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Roam Maps<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/12436a0c81f130a8a57c8a73adfa6b3b.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/12436a0c81f130a8a57c8a73adfa6b3b.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/12436a0c81f130a8a57c8a73adfa6b3b.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/802e944a19bb02836387475686070fd2.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/802e944a19bb02836387475686070fd2.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=267 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/338c313cb09d27a4e981846b32db3863.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/338c313cb09d27a4e981846b32db3863.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/338c313cb09d27a4e981846b32db3863.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/c7f0dbe0f4b61b42bb6a084c5a02c8d6.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/c7f0dbe0f4b61b42bb6a084c5a02c8d6.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/c7f0dbe0f4b61b42bb6a084c5a02c8d6.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/8ebe3b99e176073fe887d6f9c950bbc6.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/8ebe3b99e176073fe887d6f9c950bbc6.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/8ebe3b99e176073fe887d6f9c950bbc6.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring punishing, yet satisfying ragdoll simulation. Ride well or you're gonna go flying off track at high speeds. Cause a crash &amp; your rider tumbles and reacts realistically to the impact — no scripted animations, just physics doing its thing. It adds a layer of consequence to every reckless move you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/b55b4d3eb1ddc3c24d45c3bf7c5e262f.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/b55b4d3eb1ddc3c24d45c3bf7c5e262f.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=190 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/00eabfb3e1e7229d7dffd094a1671ac1.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/00eabfb3e1e7229d7dffd094a1671ac1.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/00eabfb3e1e7229d7dffd094a1671ac1.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Whether you're attempting a difficult climb, exploring a new route, improving your best run, or uncovering the next chapter of the journey, Slope Riders offers a focused off-road riding experience built around momentum, control, and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To see a lot more coming to the final game, be sure to Wishlist our Game. We'd be Glad to have your Support.<br><i>Help us keep the Engine Running and get this game across the Finish Line to you ppl.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/9aceae0fb60bd77d4fe09ed722e07af5.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/9aceae0fb60bd77d4fe09ed722e07af5.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/9aceae0fb60bd77d4fe09ed722e07af5.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Conquer the Slopes, Ride with Thrill!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slope Rider is a story-based off-road motorbike game. Carve across diverse terrain, Beat record times, race against Ghosts, and explore Open Areas across forests, snow, deserts, and rocky canyons. And live the story of a fallen champion's comeback.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/ab2eee87b916f4c0b6fec6806109d9c3.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/ab2eee87b916f4c0b6fec6806109d9c3.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/ab2eee87b916f4c0b6fec6806109d9c3.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slope Rider is a story-based motorbike game focused on terrain traversal, traction, control, and momentum. Ride across steep hills, rocky mountain paths, snowy slopes, and desert landscapes. Every climb requires careful throttle control and weight balance, as pushing too hard can send you tumbling back down the slopes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/4037939a784ec1b5e5948c6ba862ee5e.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/4037939a784ec1b5e5948c6ba862ee5e.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=190 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f7faf2099f41de172d58f62c894ba072.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f7faf2099f41de172d58f62c894ba072.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f7faf2099f41de172d58f62c894ba072.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/7d0a04d856c76bef42e4284f084d08a7.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/7d0a04d856c76bef42e4284f084d08a7.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/7d0a04d856c76bef42e4284f084d08a7.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/86d1d8ebfdc239bfc1eafb9b630c2d15.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/86d1d8ebfdc239bfc1eafb9b630c2d15.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/86d1d8ebfdc239bfc1eafb9b630c2d15.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The terrain is designed to reward precision and experimentation. Learn how different surfaces affect your bike, discover efficient routes, and master increasingly demanding climbs across a variety of environments. Progress through events and challenges while a light story unfolds through in-game cutscenes, following a former champion's journey back to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2000e1f3ae3ac7f6d8722c66bebee724.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/2000e1f3ae3ac7f6d8722c66bebee724.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=267 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/eb6c9ba67dbd529721b90ce6e8a8f7a8.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/eb6c9ba67dbd529721b90ce6e8a8f7a8.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/eb6c9ba67dbd529721b90ce6e8a8f7a8.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/0299da7d1951bbfad918a4b4bb06f0f1.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/0299da7d1951bbfad918a4b4bb06f0f1.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/0299da7d1951bbfad918a4b4bb06f0f1.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/27afb01f6ee3b1ef5f31907de0e270f3.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/27afb01f6ee3b1ef5f31907de0e270f3.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/27afb01f6ee3b1ef5f31907de0e270f3.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features realistic weight shifting controls and bike dynamics. Leaning too far forward or back changes how your bike grips and climbs, so you need to constantly adjust your balance on steep or uneven terrain. And now it's less about speed and more about control — a small mistiming in weight shift can cost you a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/9963dc0059304023d57cf696cf3a7b3d.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/9963dc0059304023d57cf696cf3a7b3d.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=190 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/e4b4442cced8adfa9474acfc4118e3d6.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/e4b4442cced8adfa9474acfc4118e3d6.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/e4b4442cced8adfa9474acfc4118e3d6.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/cf40a836209607748ba268a0cf99f21e.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/cf40a836209607748ba268a0cf99f21e.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/cf40a836209607748ba268a0cf99f21e.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse environments including forests, deserts, snowy regions, and rocky ranges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character and bike customization options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ragdoll crash system with dynamic rider reactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person and Third Person Camera Options with Look Back like fun Angles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2cc5dd23539ed9a59011e96577411a23.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2cc5dd23539ed9a59011e96577411a23.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2cc5dd23539ed9a59011e96577411a23.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/97726c34497ff8421debc90bf024a57a.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/97726c34497ff8421debc90bf024a57a.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/97726c34497ff8421debc90bf024a57a.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-driven motorcycle handling focused on balance and traction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handcrafted levels designed around exploration and skill-based progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light narrative story that follows a rider's struggle, setbacks, and return to competitive success.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessible controls with depth for players who enjoy mastering vehicle physics.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f0d582490bf064430caf0322f8944aa2.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f0d582490bf064430caf0322f8944aa2.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/f0d582490bf064430caf0322f8944aa2.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2658cd6404b53a4c5081bd277fc9373f.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2658cd6404b53a4c5081bd277fc9373f.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/2658cd6404b53a4c5081bd277fc9373f.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Available Modes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hill Climb Fests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Downhill Racing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Roam Maps<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/12436a0c81f130a8a57c8a73adfa6b3b.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/12436a0c81f130a8a57c8a73adfa6b3b.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/12436a0c81f130a8a57c8a73adfa6b3b.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/802e944a19bb02836387475686070fd2.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/802e944a19bb02836387475686070fd2.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=267 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/338c313cb09d27a4e981846b32db3863.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/338c313cb09d27a4e981846b32db3863.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/338c313cb09d27a4e981846b32db3863.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/c7f0dbe0f4b61b42bb6a084c5a02c8d6.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/c7f0dbe0f4b61b42bb6a084c5a02c8d6.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/c7f0dbe0f4b61b42bb6a084c5a02c8d6.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/8ebe3b99e176073fe887d6f9c950bbc6.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/8ebe3b99e176073fe887d6f9c950bbc6.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/8ebe3b99e176073fe887d6f9c950bbc6.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring punishing, yet satisfying ragdoll simulation. Ride well or you're gonna go flying off track at high speeds. Cause a crash &amp; your rider tumbles and reacts realistically to the impact — no scripted animations, just physics doing its thing. It adds a layer of consequence to every reckless move you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/b55b4d3eb1ddc3c24d45c3bf7c5e262f.avif?t=1786737893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras_big/b55b4d3eb1ddc3c24d45c3bf7c5e262f.webp?t=1786737893 width=1560 height=190 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/00eabfb3e1e7229d7dffd094a1671ac1.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/00eabfb3e1e7229d7dffd094a1671ac1.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/00eabfb3e1e7229d7dffd094a1671ac1.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Whether you're attempting a difficult climb, exploring a new route, improving your best run, or uncovering the next chapter of the journey, Slope Riders offers a focused off-road riding experience built around momentum, control, and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To see a lot more coming to the final game, be sure to Wishlist our Game. We'd be Glad to have your Support.<br><i>Help us keep the Engine Running and get this game across the Finish Line to you ppl.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/9aceae0fb60bd77d4fe09ed722e07af5.poster.avif?t=1786737893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/9aceae0fb60bd77d4fe09ed722e07af5.webm?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/extras/9aceae0fb60bd77d4fe09ed722e07af5.mp4?t=1786737893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Live the story of a fallen champion’s comeback in this story rich off-road motorbike game. Balance and hold traction while carving across forests, snow, deserts, and rocky canyons. Beat record times, race ghosts, and explore open areas.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/07cf8e55c94d10ad9f4e04533324d6b0dc5ea23f/header.jpg?t=1786737893", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4826810/70893c695693e081320c8e917d8b0d8939adce06/capsule_231